{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "从来不迟到的老大  (The Boss Who Is Never Late)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 14 of Behind the Scenes. While Kaiwen teases Bu Xiaogu about admiring a famous singer, punctual workaholic Chun Yuqiao arrives late for the very first time alongside Xin Huimei. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大你不知道吧，小谷迷荣思纶有一阵子了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "男神还挺多，还不挑。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不好意思，我迟到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没事，我们不等大腕我们等谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你知道我这个人工作从来不迟到，今天真的是第一次。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真的没事，这等等也是常事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "知道我起晚了，为什么不提醒我一下呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "打个电话或者发个信息也好呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对不起啊，这件事情是我的不对。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "难免也会不靠谱一下，所以你别生气，以后不会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不好意思啊，我去一下化妆间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好，我陪她去趟化妆间。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大你不知道吧，小谷迷荣思纶有一阵子了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, you probably did not know Xiaogu has been a fan of Rong Silun for quite a while.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "男神还挺多，还不挑。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She certainly has plenty of idols and is not picky.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不好意思，我迟到了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, everyone—I am late.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "没事，我们不等大腕我们等谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No problem at all—if we do not wait for a superstar, who would we wait for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你知道我这个人工作从来不迟到，今天真的是第一次。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You know I am never late for work; today is truly the very first time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "真的没事，这等等也是常事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It really is fine; waiting a little is routine in our line of work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "知道我起晚了，为什么不提醒我一下呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Knowing I overslept, why did you not give me a wake-up reminder?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "打个电话或者发个信息也好呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even making a phone call or sending a text message would have helped.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "对不起啊，这件事情是我的不对。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry—this one was my fault.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "难免也会不靠谱一下，所以你别生气，以后不会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even I slip up once in a while, so do not be upset; it will not happen again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不好意思啊，我去一下化妆间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, let me head over to the dressing room.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "好，我陪她去趟化妆间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I will walk her over to the dressing room.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大你不知道吧，小谷迷荣思纶有一阵子了。",
      "gap": 0.5
